                <pb facs="1221" n="1063" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1063"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Embassy at Tokyo</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-03-22"><hi rendition="#italic">March 22,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root directs the embassy to express in fitting terms sorrow and sympathy of
                    the President and American people for the awful calamity in Formosa.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
